TY  - JOUR
ID  - arxiv-0801.0083v4
AU  - YEKUTIELI, AMNON
TI  - CENTRAL EXTENSIONS OF GERBES
DA  - D:20210722
UR  - https://arxiv.org/abs/0801.0083
AB  - We introduce the notion of central extension of gerbes on a topo- logical space X. We show that there are obstruction classes to lifting objects and isomorphisms in a central extension. We also discuss pronilpotent gerbes. These results are used in the paper [Ye] to study twisted deformation quanti- zation on algebraic varieties.
ER  - 
